# NexoGestao production backup — VERSIONED TEMPLATE
# NOT PROOF OF INSTALLATION. Replace both placeholders before an operator installs it.
# NEXO_REPOSITORY_ROOT must be an absolute checkout path; the secrets file stays outside Git.
# RETENTION_DAYS belongs in the explicit environment file and is not an RPO.
#
# Example rendering target (do not execute this file as-is):
# 0 2 * * * <service-user> NEXO_BACKUP_ENV_FILE=/absolute/outside-git/backup-production.env <NEXO_REPOSITORY_ROOT>/scripts/run-production-backup.sh

0 2 * * * <service-user> NEXO_BACKUP_ENV_FILE=/absolute/outside-git/backup-production.env <NEXO_REPOSITORY_ROOT>/scripts/run-production-backup.sh
